{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon Song Tavern: Pumpkin Masquerade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 As\u00a0candlelight flickers, the tavern transforms into a pumpkin party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>\u201cPumpkin Masquerade\u201d DLC</strong>\u00a0includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Furniture Set: Halloween Tavern</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Lantern Dining Table</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bat Silhouette Wall Decor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiderweb Curtains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candlelit Fireplace Mantel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Glow Lamp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phantom Pumpkin Rug</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halloween Night Doormat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Outfits</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Warlock Outfit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candy Witch Dress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Pet &amp; New Outfit for Luca</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boo-Boo the Little Ghost: </strong>A tiny ghost wearing a wizard hat and holding a pumpkin lantern, always floating by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Festive Luca: </strong>Your baby dragon Luca joins the party, wearing a pumpkin bowtie and a jaunty little hat!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From decorating your tavern to dressing up for the night\u00a0or celebrating with Boo-Boo and Luca, this DLC wraps you in the perfect blend of spooky and sweet Halloween vibes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010310?t=1762331673","background_raw":"https://store